## Code Example
```python
# flatten nested json
import json

def flatten(record):
    flat = {}
    for k, v in record.items():
        if isinstance(v, dict):
            for kk, vv in v.items():
                flat[f"{k}_{kk}"] = vv
        else:
            flat[k] = v
    return flat
```
